<Slide
  style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#F7F3EA',
    fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif",
    padding: '68px 84px 56px 84px',
    position: 'relative',
  }}
>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 42, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0E3B3A', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
    信息不够，它就先问
  </Text>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 500, color: '#14110F', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>
    不硬答，也不把同一个问题问第二遍。
  </Text>

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, marginTop: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 400, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 26, paddingTop: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B0512E', letterSpacing: 1, marginTop: 4 }}>01</Text>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 700, color: '#14110F' }}>槽位不够就问</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B6459', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            问时长、问诱因，一次只问必要的那一个
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 360, height: 1, background: 'rgba(20,17,15,0.10)' }} />
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B0512E', letterSpacing: 1, marginTop: 4 }}>02</Text>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 700, color: '#14110F' }}>一句话补齐就给结论</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B6459', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            「三天了」→ 直接出科室卡，不重复追问
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 360, height: 1, background: 'rgba(20,17,15,0.10)' }} />
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B0512E', letterSpacing: 1, marginTop: 4 }}>03</Text>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 700, color: '#14110F' }}>追问有上限</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B6459', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            会话级记忆，问到信息够了就停
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFCF5', padding: 6, border: '1px solid rgba(20,17,15,0.16)' }}>
        <Image src="assets/chat-clarify-1.png" style={{ width: 608, height: 386 }} />
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6459' }}>实拍：示例「模糊 → 追问」，输入"最近老是头晕"后的第一轮。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 84, right: 84, bottom: 28, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6459', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>智诊通</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#B0512E', fontWeight: 600 }}>去之前</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(107,100,89,0.5)' }}>—</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(107,100,89,0.5)' }}>在院内</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(107,100,89,0.5)' }}>—</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(107,100,89,0.5)' }}>回家后</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6459' }}>04</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
